# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — release tarball export-ignore 排除 docs/examples/tests 致 CMake 默认 option 失败 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-22
# Software: emhash 1.2.0
# Gate: cmake configure（OHOS aarch64）
# Status: UNMATCHED — 与 E458 触发面（add_subdirectory 缺目录）重叠但根因/方案不同；E321 仅 header-only 框架层，待 promote
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id: DRAFT-emhash-1.2.0-tarball-export-ignore-cmake-option-disabled
severity: 2
category: ohos, cmake, packaging, source-download, tarball
trigger_tool: cmake
phase: configuration
approach: 取官方 codeload tarball 后先核对顶层目录与 .gitattributes export-ignore
  规则（对照 git tag 树 API），据此关闭引用被排除目录的 CMake option
  （-DWITH_EXAMPLES=OFF -DWITH_TESTS=OFF -DWITH_BENCHMARKS=OFF）；被排除的是非必需
  构建单元可安全关闭，必需依赖被排除时按 E458 恢复依赖而非关 option

keywords: export-ignore, .gitattributes, release tarball, codeload, add_subdirectory, WITH_EXAMPLES, cmake option

error_signature: add_subdirectory given source.*which is not an existing directory|WITH_EXAMPLES|docs/examples
match_keywords: export-ignore,gitattributes,release,tarball,add_subdirectory,WITH_EXAMPLES,cmake,docs/examples

root_cause: GitHub codeload release tarball 按 .gitattributes export-ignore 排除
  docs/examples、tests、bench、thirdparty、scripts（emhash v1.2.0 已核验 blob
  556018ba…），但 CMakeLists 默认 WITH_EXAMPLES=ON 直接 add_subdirectory 引用被排除
  目录 → configure 失败；git tag 完整树实际含这些目录，属发布物包装排除
affected_scope: 任意官方 release tarball export-ignore 掉 docs/examples 等目录的
  CMake 库；emhash 1.2.0 适配实测；E458（restinio bundled 依赖缺失）触发面重叠但
  根因/方案不同，属新增差异

prescan_pattern: add_subdirectory.*not an existing directory|WITH_EXAMPLES|WITH_TESTS|WITH_BENCHMARKS
prescan_globs: "*.txt, *.cmake, conanfile.py"
